noPhotos

# higher D** D3000 -> D* pi pi (ISGW2, PHSP), as the LHCb CocktailHigher
# LHCb-style cocktail component (DecFiles Sim10 11874430/12873450, 11676012/12675402), e/mu 50/50

Alias MyD3000 D_2*+
Alias MyantiD3000 D_2*-
ChargeConj MyD3000 MyantiD3000
Particle MyD3000 2.972 0.188
Particle MyantiD3000 2.972 0.188
# D(3000) is not in the basf2 particle table: emulated by a D_2* alias with m, Gamma from the PDG/LHCb

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0  B0sig  anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
0.5  MyD3000  e-  anti-nu_e   ISGW2;
0.5  MyD3000  mu-  anti-nu_mu  ISGW2;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

Decay MyD3000
1.0  D*+  pi+  pi-   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay MyantiD3000

End
